@page "/"

<h1>Smart-X IoT Management System</h1>

<p>
    Smart-X is used to register, monitor and manage IoT sensors from one dashboard.
</p>

<div class="row mt-4">

    <div class="col-md-4 mb-3">
        <div class="card p-3 h-100">
            <h4>Sensor Data Ingestion and Telemetry</h4>

            <p>
                Register IoT sensors, monitor telemetry readings and manage sensor-related data.
            </p>

            <p>
                <strong>Status:</strong> Available in Part 1
            </p>

            <a class="btn btn-primary" href="sensors">
                Open Sensor Management
            </a>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="col-md-4 mb-3">
        <div class="card p-3 h-100">
            <h4>Real-Time Command Stream and History</h4>

            <p>
                This section will support real-time device commands and historical telemetry data.
            </p>

            <p>
                <strong>Status:</strong> Coming in Part 2
            </p>

            <button class="btn btn-secondary" disabled>
                Not Available Yet
            </button>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="col-md-4 mb-3">
        <div class="card p-3 h-100">
            <h4>Network Topology and Mesh Routing</h4>

            <p>
                This section will display network topology and routing between Smart-X IoT devices.
            </p>

            <p>
                <strong>Status:</strong> Coming in Final PoE
            </p>

            <button class="btn btn-secondary" disabled>
                Not Available Yet
            </button>
        </div>
    </div>

</div>

<hr />

<h3 class="mt-4">Part 1 Tools</h3>

<div class="mt-3">
    <a class="btn btn-outline-primary me-2" href="dashboard">
        Telemetry Dashboard
    </a>

    <a class="btn btn-outline-primary" href="files">
        Sensor File Upload
    </a>
</div>